title: The Independents
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and uspd_timer <= 0 and uspd_exists = 1
on-arrival: uspd_timer = 3; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: germany

= The Independents

[? if uspd_split = 0 : The Independent Social Democrats stand between Ebert's party and ours. Their left wing has hundreds of thousands of members in Halle, Leipzig and Berlin, and is closer to us than to its own leaders. ?][? if uspd_split = 1 : Since Halle, the Independents who refused Moscow's conditions carry on as a smaller party under Crispien, Dittmann and Hilferding, drifting back towards the SPD. ?]

- @joint: Propose joint demonstrations.
- @left_wing: Court the left wing in Halle.
- @denounce: Denounce the leaders as centrists.
- @easy_discard

@joint
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Relations with the Independents improve a great deal.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any united front.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.uspd_relation += 12;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

@left_wing
subtitle: Some of their best members cross over to us in Halle[? if uspd_split = 0 : . Their leaders will not forgive it. ?][? if uspd_split = 1 : , though fewer are left to take. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.district_halle_members += (Q.uspd_split ? 0.3 : 0.8) * Math.max(1, Q.district_halle_members / 10);
Q.district_halle_loyalty += 5;
Q.uspd_relation -= 5;
!}

Shop stewards from Leuna and the Mansfeld pits come to our office with their whole branch behind them.

@denounce
subtitle: The Left and the radicals like it. The Independents return the favour.
on-arrival: {!
Q.uspd_relation -= 10;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 5;
if (!Q.ultraleft_gone) {
    Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 5;
}
!}
